find 
X509v3 extensions:
    X509v3 Subject Alternative Name:
        IP Address:127.0.0.1


explain
-addext "subjectAltName=IP:127.0.0.1": Adds the SAN for the IP address 127.0.0.1.
-extfile <(echo "subjectAltName=IP:127.0.0.1"): Ensures the SAN is included in the signed certificate.
modern browsers (since 2017) ignore CN and require a SAN that matches the accessed hostname or IP. Without a SAN, Chrome will reject the certificate.

